  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Colombia - Iniciativa Regional para la Eliminacin de la Malaria (IREM) en Mesoamrica y Repblica Dominicana</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia - Regional Malaria Elimination Initiative (RMEI) in Mesoamerica and Dominican Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la operacin es contribuir a la reduccin de los casos de malaria al ao 2020 en Colombia a travs de mejoras en el acceso a servicios de prevencin, diagnstico y tratamiento, y mediante la deteccin y manejo oportuno de los casos autctonos e importados</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the operation is to contribute to the reduction of malaria cases by 2020 in Colombia through improvements in access to prevention, diagnosis and treatment services, and through the timely detection and management of autochthonous and imported cases.</narrative>
  </description>
